{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36211","headline":"因话天台胜异仍送罗道士 · 方干","name":"因话天台胜异仍送罗道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"积翠千层一径开，遥盘山腹到琼台。\n藕花飘落前岩去，桂子流从别洞来。\n石上丛林碍星斗，窗边瀑布走风雷。\n纵云孤鹤无留滞，定恐烟萝不放回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}